entry .HalfWind
  info
      - the eight half winds of a 16-point rose, from `NorthNortheast` to `NorthNorthwest`
      + les huit demi-vents d'une rose à 16 points, de `NorthNortheast` à `NorthNorthwest`
  detail
      - The points between each cardinal and intercardinal wind, which a `Compass[16]` rose adds
      - to the eight: `NorthNortheast`, `EastNortheast`, `EastSoutheast`, `SouthSoutheast`,
      - `SouthSouthwest`, `WestSouthwest`, `WestNorthwest` and `NorthNorthwest`. The cases are
      - exported to the `geodesy` package and the umbrella, so they are written bare. Unlike
      - `CardinalWind` and `IntercardinalWind`, a half wind has no `Showable` arrow.
      + Les points situés entre chaque vent cardinal et intercardinal, qu'une rose `Compass[16]`
      + ajoute aux huit : `NorthNortheast`, `EastNortheast`, `EastSoutheast`, `SouthSoutheast`,
      + `SouthSouthwest`, `WestSouthwest`, `WestNorthwest` et `NorthNorthwest`. Les cas sont
      + exportés dans le package `geodesy` et le package parapluie ; ils s'écrivent donc seuls.
      + Contrairement à `CardinalWind` et `IntercardinalWind`, un demi-vent n'a pas de flèche
      + `Showable`.

